---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About SiteMate"
  description="SiteMate is a cross-device workspace for small field-service businesses, built with FastAPI, PostgreSQL, and Flutter."
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-wrap px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <h1 class="text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[2.4rem]">
      About SiteMate
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.05rem] text-muted">
      SiteMate is being built as a learning-driven, production-minded project
      exploring modern cross-platform development, native mobile development,
      backend engineering, databases, APIs, offline-first architecture, and
      CI/CD.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.05rem] text-muted">
      The MVP backend is built with Python, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL. The
      mobile and desktop clients are built with Flutter, with native Swift,
      SwiftUI, and Kotlin integrations where appropriate.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
